      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC01-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "These Akashic Records are just Mythic recreations of the past, yes? How can they inflict harm? How can they interact with us at all?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FORB_078.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752246,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC01-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "On the Island of the Storm, the Wizard said they saw one create a physical Circuit Rune from nothing. This is Conjuration magic after all.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-FORB_081.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752248,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC01-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Perhaps it is less that we are in a recording, than a summoning spell. And like all summons, it can be called, interacted with and dismissed.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-FORB_082.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752248,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC01-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "As you say, fascinating. Perhaps we should investigate this era further. Wizard, you continue hunting Miranda in the other portals.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FORB_079.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752246,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
